+     * <p>
+     * Lexical normalization alone removes {@code ".."} segments but does not follow symbolic links, so a link inside a fence pointing outside it would pass.
+     * {@link Path#toRealPath(java.nio.file.LinkOption...)} needs the path to exist, so resolve the deepest existing ancestor for real and re-attach the
+     * remaining segments; a path that does not exist yet cannot leak anything through a link that is not there.
+     * </p>
